import currency-rates

currency CHF 0.01
currency USD 0.01

tag taxable
tag not-taxable
tag undeclared
tag deductible
tag not-deductible

account equity:starting
account assets:bank
  + attach evidence.txt
  + tag taxable
account assets:pillar-3a
  + attach evidence.txt
  + tag not-taxable
account assets:old-pillar-3a
  + attach evidence.txt
  + tag not-taxable
account assets:movables
  + attach evidence.txt
  + tag taxable
account assets:machinery
  + attach evidence.txt
  + tag taxable
account expenses:rent:homeoffice
account expenses:rent:private
account expenses:cloud
account expenses:insurance:third-pillar
account income:foreign
account income:domestic
account income:gifts
  + tag undeclared

2025-12-31
  | Opening balances
  * equity:starting      -302000 CHF
  * assets:bank           280000 CHF
  * assets:old-pillar-3a   20000 CHF
  * assets:machinery        2000 CHF
  * assets:movables            0 CHF

2025-12-31
  | Last year's contribution, which does not count for this year
  * assets:bank      -7000 CHF
  * assets:pillar-3a  7000 CHF
  + tag deductible
  + attach evidence.txt

2026-03-01
  | Foreign client, at 0.80
  * assets:bank      10000 USD
  * income:foreign  -10000 USD
  + attach evidence.txt

2026-04-01
  | Domestic client
  * assets:bank      90000 CHF
  * income:domestic -90000 CHF
  + attach evidence.txt

2026-05-01
  | Gift, which is not revenue
  * assets:bank   1000 CHF
  * income:gifts -1000 CHF

2026-06-01
  | Rent, a quarter of which is for the home office
  * assets:bank              -4000 CHF
  * expenses:rent:homeoffice  1000 CHF
  * expenses:rent:private     3000 CHF
  + tag deductible

2026-06-15
  | Cloud bill, an other business expense
  * assets:bank    -3000 CHF
  * expenses:cloud  3000 CHF
  + tag deductible
  + attach evidence.txt

2026-08-01
  | Transfer from another third pillar, which is not a contribution
  * assets:old-pillar-3a -20000 CHF
  * assets:pillar-3a      20000 CHF
  + tag not-deductible

2026-09-01
  | Contribution, which leaves less than a round amount of room
  * assets:bank      -14238 CHF
  * assets:pillar-3a  14238 CHF
  + tag deductible
  + attach evidence.txt

2026-10-01
  | Third pillar insurance premium
  * assets:bank                       -2000 CHF
  * expenses:insurance:third-pillar    2000 CHF
  + tag deductible
  + attach evidence.txt
